{"id":"6d4e0dd8108a0768","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-closed-operator.md","title":"Closed Operator","display":"df-closed-operator — Closed Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-closed-operator","aliases":["58-df-closed-operator","Closed Operator"],"display":"df-closed-operator — Closed Operator","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-closed-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-closed-operator</span><span>Closed Operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-closed-operator — Closed Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f67456d74b418241\" href=\"?note=f67456d74b418241\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md\">../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3600401d4adbcbd4\" href=\"?note=3600401d4adbcbd4\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md\">../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,H,K,D,\\tau_H,\\tau_K\\in V\">\\(T,H,K,D,\\tau_H,\\tau_K\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb K}\">\\(\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb K}\\)</span> (linear-map predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f67456d74b418241\" href=\"?note=f67456d74b418241\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md\">../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop6ClosedSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop6ClosedSet}_S\\)</span> (closed-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3600401d4adbcbd4\" href=\"?note=3600401d4adbcbd4\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md\">../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_H\\oplus\\tau_K\">\\(\\tau_H\\oplus\\tau_K\\)</span> (product topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\times K\">\\(H\\times K\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedOperator}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosedOperator}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (closed-operator predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{ClosedOperator}_S(T,H,K)\\leftrightarrow\\exists D\\subseteq H\\;\\bigl(T\\in K^D\\land\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;D,K)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop6ClosedSet}_S(H\\times K,\\tau_H\\oplus\\tau_K,\\{\\langle x,T(x)\\rangle:x\\in D\\})\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{ClosedOperator}_S(T,H,K)\\leftrightarrow\\exists D\\subseteq H\\;\\bigl(T\\in K^D\\land\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;D,K)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop6ClosedSet}_S(H\\times K,\\tau_H\\oplus\\tau_K,\\{\\langle x,T(x)\\rangle:x\\in D\\})\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Closed: the graph of the possibly unbounded operator, with its actual domain, is closed in the product topology.</li>\n<li>Closability and graph closure are related notions, but are not part of this defining clause.</li>\n<li>Unbounded: not defined everywhere, not continuous</li>\n<li>Semibounded: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle Tx, x\\rangle \\geq c\\|x\\|^2\">\\(\\langle Tx, x\\rangle \\geq c\\|x\\|^2\\)</span></li>\n<li>Core: dense subset <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> such that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar{T}|_D = T\">\\(\\bar{T}|_D = T\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Reed and Simon, Functional Analysis</li>\n<li>Kato, Perturbation Theory for Linear Operators</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"f67456d74b418241","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"3600401d4adbcbd4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"f67456d74b418241","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb K}$ (linear-map predicate, see [[../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"3600401d4adbcbd4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop6ClosedSet}_S$ (closed-set predicate, see [[../batch14/58-df-closed-set.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,H,K,D,\\tau_H,\\tau_K\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb K}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop6ClosedSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_H\\oplus\\tau_K","display":false},{"tex":"H\\times K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClosedOperator}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{ClosedOperator}_S(T,H,K)\\leftrightarrow\\exists D\\subseteq H\\;\\bigl(T\\in K^D\\land\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;D,K)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop6ClosedSet}_S(H\\times K,\\tau_H\\oplus\\tau_K,\\{\\langle x,T(x)\\rangle:x\\in D\\})\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\langle Tx, x\\rangle \\geq c\\|x\\|^2","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar{T}|_D = T","display":false}],"bytes":1489,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-288","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-closed-operator.md|58-df-closed-operator]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["f67456d74b418241","3600401d4adbcbd4"]}